To send app requests using Facebook iOS SDK, follow these steps:

1) Use the deprecated API with FBDialog:
```objc
NSMutableDictionary* params = [NSMutableDictionary dictionaryWithObjectsAndKeys:@"Hi please add me as a friend.", @"message", friendId, @"to", nil];
[appDelegate.facebook dialog:@"apprequests" andParams:params andDelegate:self];
```

2) Ensure your app is registered on Facebook for App Integration.

3) Update the expirationDate of *m_pFacebook object when session state changes:
```objc
- (void)sessionStateChanged:(FBSession*)session state:(FBSessionState)state error:(NSError*)error {
  switch(state) {
    case FBSessionStateOpen: 
      [m_pFacebook fbDialogLogin:session.accessToken expirationDate:session.expirationDate];
      break;
  }
}
```

