To add a new section in INI file using TJvAppIniFileStorage, you need to create a new section first and then write values into it. Here's how:

```delphi
var
  Ini: TJvAppIniFile;
begin
  Ini := TJvAppIniFile.Create('path_to_your_ini_file.ini');
  try
    // Create a new section
    Ini.WriteSection('NewSectionName', ['Key1=Value1', 'Key2=Value2']);
  finally
    Ini.Free;
  end;
```

This code snippet creates a new section named 'NewSectionName' and writes two key-value pairs into it. Adjust the path to your INI file and keys/values as needed for your application.
URL: [1]

bm25_raw_answer:
To add a new section in an INI file using TJvAppIniFileStorage, you can use the following approach:

```delphi
procedure AddNewSection(const IniFileName: string; const SectionName: string);
var
  IniStream: TMemoryStream;
begin
  IniStream := TMemoryStream.Create;
  try
    IniStream.WriteBuffer(Format('%s = %s', [SectionName, '']), Length('[%s'] + #13#10); // Format the section name and add a newline
    TJvAppIniFileStorage.DefaultSection := SectionName; // Set default section to newly added one
    TJvAppIniFileStorage.WriteFromFile(IniStream, IniFileName);
  finally
    IniStream.Free;
  end;
end;
```

This code creates a new section in the INI file by first writing the section name and then setting the `DefaultSection` property of `TJvAppIniFileStorage` to this newly added section.

hybrid_raw_answer:
To add a new section in an INI file using TJvAppIniFileStorage, you can use the following approach:

```delphi
procedure AddNewSection(const IniFileName: string; const SectionName: string);
var
  IniStream: TMemoryStream;
begin
  IniStream := TMemoryStream.Create;
  try
    IniStream.WriteBuffer(Format('[' + SectionName + ']', [SectionName]), Length('[[') + Length(SectionName) + 2); // Format the section name with square brackets
    TJvAppIniFileStorage.DefaultSection := SectionName; // Set default section to newly added one
    TJvAppIniFileStorage.WriteStream(IniFileName, IniStream);
  finally
    IniStream.Free;
  end;
end;
```

This code creates a new section in the specified INI file by first writing the formatted section name into a memory stream and then using TJvAppIniFileStorage to write this stream to the INI file.

